 26-10-29. Check the organizer's call before relying on it.\nFormat: Paper
 -based\nOfficial source: https://www.siam.org/conferences-events/siam-con
 ferences/sdm26/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#sdm-
 2027\nNotes: As of 2026-10-29 SIAM describes SDM as yearly but lists no S
